{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Your phone rings.|The whole carriage turns."},{"id":"s2","text":"Everyone stares.|Wrong ringtone."},{"id":"s3","text":"Train rules."},{"id":"s4","text":"Thumb flicks the switch."},{"id":"s5","text":"Manner mode on.|Silence returns."},{"id":"s6","text":"She—"},{"id":"s7","text":"You sit still.|The train rolls on."},{"id":"s8","text":"Silent buzz.|Nobody notices."},{"id":"s9","text":"Your ringtone just met fifty strangers."},{"id":"n1","text":"Manner mode on.|Before you board."},{"id":"n2","text":"Calls wait.|Text instead."},{"id":"n3","text":"Silent is polite.|Vibrate is fine."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}